@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Products (cold cache)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Products (warm cache)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Product by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### Search products
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/products?q=mouse

### User profile (cached)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Update user (invalidate cache)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ava Updated"
}

### Write-through update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1/write-through
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ava.new@example.com"
}

### Write-behind update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1/write-behind
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Queued Update"
}

### Process write-behind queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/jobs/write-behind/process

### Rate limit (run multiple times)
GET {{baseUrl}}/limited-endpoint

### Redis practice - strings
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/strings

### Redis practice - lists
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/lists

### Redis practice - sets
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/sets

### Redis practice - hashes
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/hashes

### Redis practice - sorted sets
GET {{baseUrl}}/practice/sorted-sets

### Pub/Sub publish
POST {{baseUrl}}/pubsub/publish?channel=demo&message=hello

### Pub/Sub subscribe
GET {{baseUrl}}/pubsub/subscribe?channel=demo&timeout=5

### Session store - save
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sessions/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "role": "admin"
}

### Session store - fetch
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/demo

### Distributed lock - acquire
POST {{baseUrl}}/locks/report/acquire?ttl=10

### Cache metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/cache

### Metrics dashboard (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/dashboard
